@startuml Tracking - View Records + New Results Notification Logic
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
boundary "Main App\n(MainView + Navigator)" as MainUI
boundary "Tracking Hub\n(TrackingHubView/TrackingView)" as TrackingUI
control "TrackingController" as TrackingC
control "TrackingService" as TrackingS
entity "Test/Prescription/Appointment DAOs/DB" as TrackingDB
control "ResultAlertService" as Alerts
entity "TestDAO / UserDAO\n(User.last_results_seen_at)" as AlertDB
control "NotificationDispatcher" as Dispatch
boundary "In-app Notification" as Notif

== Open Tracking ==
User -> MainUI: Click "Tracking"
MainUI -> TrackingUI: show tracking hub
TrackingUI -> TrackingC: initialize / refresh
TrackingC -> TrackingS: getTestResults/getPrescriptions/getPastAppointments
TrackingS -> TrackingDB: query records
TrackingDB --> TrackingS: lists
TrackingS --> TrackingC: lists
TrackingC --> TrackingUI: render entries

== New test results notification logic ==
note over TrackingC: first Tracking visit after login,\nand every return to the tab (in the background)
TrackingC -> Alerts: newResults(userId)
Alerts -> AlertDB: released tests newer than last_results_seen_at,\nor changed to a final result since
AlertDB --> Alerts: NewResults(entries, watermark)\n(no result values)
Alerts --> TrackingC: NewResults

alt something new
  TrackingC -> Dispatch: notifyUser(userId, no email,\nTestResultNotification per entry)\n("updated result" wording when resultUpdated)
  Dispatch -> Notif: show popup(s)
  TrackingC -> Alerts: markSeen(userId, watermark)
  Alerts -> AlertDB: set last_results_seen_at = watermark
else nothing new
  TrackingC --> TrackingUI: no notifications
end
note right of Dispatch: no email here: staff release already emailed

@enduml
